WEBVTT

00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:12,220
Should I take supplements on chemo day?

00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:17,440
Should I stop coffee enemas after chemo at all?

00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:22,380
So should I stop should I take my supplements on my day of chemo?

00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:30,640
Well, usually your chemo and food fusion is going to be typically at the morning and it may last anywhere from a couple hours to half the day

00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,220
I

00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:37,100
Suggest you don't take your supplements in the morning before you go and do your infusion

00:00:37,180 --> 00:00:43,260
But you can certainly take your afternoon supplements if you're feeling up to it. If you're feeling sick

00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,500
that afternoon

00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:51,460
And you don't feel like you can keep anything down that I would say don't worry about it. Don't stress about it

00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:55,580
Just don't take your supplements and wait till you feel better

00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:05,580
Typically, it's not the day of chemo that you feel sick though. Everybody experiences any illa that they may experience differently

00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:07,580
so

00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:10,700
It's a don't take your morning supplements, but take

00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:14,380
The afternoon when you get home from your infusion if you can

00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:17,580
Should I not do a coffee enemma?

00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:22,220
Well, I would say don't do a coffee enemma at least the day of chemo

00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:26,060
You could skip the coffee enemma the next day too

00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,580
But then go back to doing your coffee enemas again

00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:32,940
You could wait a maximum of two days

00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:37,100
Between the coffee enemas now if you're only doing a couple of coffee enemas a week

00:01:37,740 --> 00:01:40,700
Just wait a few days after the coffee enemma

00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:48,700
Meeting after the chemo infusion meeting don't do a coffee enemma the day of chemo maybe don't do a coffee enemma the next day

00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:51,980
On but then go back to doing your coffee enemas

